# Phase 3.1 Dedup Agent: HEAVY probabilistic-record-linkage stack, EXCLUDED
# from the slim API image. splink + duckdb + sentence-transformers (which
# pulls torch, multi-GB) + pyarrow exceed the backend container's hard 1G
# memory limit (docker-compose.prod.yml) and would OOM. The batch dedup agent
# (agents/dedup/agent.py, splink_runner.py) that uses them runs out of
# process, not inside the API image, so they are intentionally not compiled
# into requirements.txt. Re-enable only in a separate batch-agent image build.
# splink~=4.0
# duckdb~=1.1
# sentence-transformers~=3.2
# pyarrow~=18.0

